{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44392","headline":"诗三百三首 八十九 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 八十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汝爲埋头痴兀兀，爱向无明罗刹窟。\n再三劝你早修行，是你顽痴心恍惚。\n不肯信受寒山语，转转倍加业汩汩。\n直待斩首作两段，方知自身奴贼物。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}